==Notes==
* Her armor is a variation of [[Assassin Seitung armor]].
* She appears in Bukdek Byway while the [[Finding The Oracle]] quest is active. After the completion of that quest, she will continue to appear in Bukdek Byway until the [[Closer to the Stars]] quest has been accepted.
* Wields a pair of [[Sai]]. 

{{Bug|During the Norn Fighting Tournament, Nika cannot activate ''Horns of the Ox'' or ''Shattering Assault'', because she lacks an [[offhand attack]]. (Her original offhand, ''Black Lotus Strike'', was turned into a [[lead attack]].)}}

==Trivia==
*Nika is depicted in the artwork used to promote ''[[Guild Wars Factions]]'' and on the game's box art.
*Nika looked a lot like the in-game version of Vizu during the Factions World Preview Event, but her face was remodeled closer to the artwork since.
*Her Factions skill set was changed in the [[Game updates/20091022|October 22, 2009 update]]. As an ally in Raisu Palace, she uses the Factions skill set prior to that update.
**This added [[Black Mantis Thrust]] and [[Mark of Instability]], and removed [[Jagged Strike]] from her skills. 

